    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίκκασος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβολοῦ ὄνομα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐκ τῶν παραμηρίων ἱδρὼς
			ῥέων, καὶ βόλου ὄνομα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίγκασος</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίκκη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνουσία, κτλ</span>., Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κικκίδαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μινδῶνς</span> . . , Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κικκιλόνδις:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδὸς ἀφόδευμα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κικκός:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλεκτρυών, κλέπτης, διαχώρησις</span>, Id.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
